			  E. Holler (Nuclear Research Center Karlsruhe),
			  W. Kalfa (TU Chemnitz),
			  K.-P. Loehr (FU Berlin),
			  M. Muehlhaeuser (U. Karlsruhe),
			  K. Mueller (R&O Software-Technik Chemnitz),
			  A. Schill (U. Karlsruhe),
			  P. Schlichtinger (Siemens Munich),
			  G. Schuermann (GMD Berlin)

          Conference Languages:
          ---------------------
			  German and English

          Submissions:  
          ------------
			  Short papers (4 pages) and long papers (10
