-- representatives of major commercial and government end users who
have been providing leadership to OSF end user members and actively
planning end user activity.

The End User Forum represents an additional way for users to make their
voice heard by OSF, its members and the industry at large. The
objective of the Forum is to facilitate the incorporation of end user
requirements into OSF technologies.

The agenda for the Forum includes

 - updates on the activities of the EU Steering
   Committee, their strategy plan and initiatives
 - a message from David Tory, president and CEO of OSF
 - a presentation by Charles Schwab & Co. on their
   perspective on open systems
 - brief updates on OSF technologies and programs
