In article <C3MqGF.2wus@austin.ibm.com>, kumark@austin.ibm.com (Kakumanu Kumar
(Contractor)) says:

>Hi,
Hi,
  Is it possible to pass a linked list (say, a pointer to the head of
a list of structures which contain pointers to next elements) as
input/output parameter in DCE RPC?  I have to use a linked list
