1.  I don't know.

2.  I doubt it.  DCE will set up a remote pointer, and will marshall the thing
pointed to OK, but it won't know that it should track the entire pointer chain
to some end.

   You should probably just write your own marshalling funcion that converts
the LL into an array of known size.  DCE can handle that OK, I think.


