The reference platform for OSF/1 MK4.1 is the i386/486 architecture.  
However, we did include source code for the Mips processor as unsupported  
code (the initial port was done by Hugh Smith at Guelph University). The  
port to the Mips processor is not at the same level as that of the i386 in  
two respects:

o It is not self-hosting, and needs some CMU tools to build

o It needs a mixture of gnu and Mips compile tools

The Mips port has been tested on DS3100 and DS5000/200 (but not  
necessarily all configurations).

James


